e First Account Manually",[219,228,229],{},"If no account exists yet, create the first account directly in the database:",[231,232,233,256,462,465],"ol",{},[234,235,236,237,241,242,249,250,255],"li",{},"Open your MySQL management tool or database UI, such as ",[238,239,240],"code",{},"mysql",", ",[243,244,248],"a",{"href":245,"rel":246},"https:\u002F\u002Fdbeaver.io\u002F",[247],"nofollow","DBeaver",", or ",[243,251,254],{"href":252,"rel":253},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.phpmyadmin.net\u002F",[247],"PHPMyAdmin",", and connect to the database used by FiveNet or your gameserver.",[234,257,258,259,262,263,344,354,357,360],{},"Navigate to the ",[238,260,261],{},"fivenet_accounts"," table and create a new entry with the following values:",[264,265,266,279],"table",{},[267,268,269],"thead",{},[270,271,272,276],"tr",{},[273,274,275],"th",{},"Field",[273,277,278],{},"Value Description",[280,281,282,297,320,330],"tbody",{},[270,283,284,290],{},[285,286,287],"td",{},[238,288,289],{},"enabled",[285,291,292,293,296],{},"Set to ",[238,294,295],{},"1"," to enable the account.",[270,298,299,304],{},[285,300,301],{},[238,302,303],{},"license",[285,305,306,307,241,310,241,313,241,316,319],{},"Your in-game identifier\u002Flicense without any prefix (e.g., ",[238,308,309],{},"char*:",[238,311,312],{},"license:",[238,314,315],{},"steam:",[238,317,318],{},"discord:",").",[270,321,322,327],{},[285,323,324],{},[238,325,326],{},"reg_token",[285,328,329],{},"A 6-digit registration token for account registration.",[270,331,332,337],{},[285,333,334],{},[238,335,336],{},"groups",[285,338,339,340,343],{},"A JSON string array, e.g., ",[238,341,342],{},"[\"admin\"]"," (list of groups).",[345,346,347],"blockquote",{},[219,348,349,353],{},[350,351,352],"strong",{},"Note:"," Leave all other fields as they are.",[355,356],"br",{},[350,358,359],{},"Example query:",[361,362,367],"pre",{"className":363,"code":364,"language":365,"meta":366,"style":366},"language-sql shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","INSERT INTO `fivenet_accounts` (`enabled`, `license`, `reg_token`, `groups`) VALUES (1, 'YOUR_LICENSE_HERE', '123456', '[\"admin\"]');\n","sql","",[238,368,369],{"__ignoreMap":366},[370,371,374,378,382,385,388,392,394,396,398,400,402,404,406,408,410,412,414,416,418,420,422,425,428,430,432,434,437,440,442,444,446,449,451,453,455,457,459],"span",{"class":372,"line":373},"line",1,[370,375,377],{"class":376},"sbssI","INSERT INTO",[370,379,381],{"class":380},"sMK4o"," `",[370,383,261],{"class":384},"sfazB",[370,386,387],{"class":380},"`",[370,389,391],{"class":390},"sTEyZ"," (",[370,393,387],{"class":380},[370,395,289],{"class":384},[370,397,387],{"class":380},[370,399,241],{"class":390},[370,401,387],{"class":380},[370,403,303],{"class":384},[370,405,387],{"class":380},[370,407,241],{"class":390},[370,409,387],{"class":380},[370,411,326],{"class":384},[370,413,387],{"class":380},[370,415,241],{"class":390},[370,417,387],{"class":380},[370,419,336],{"class":384},[370,421,387],{"class":380},[370,423,424],{"class":390},") ",[370,426,427],{"class":376},"VALUES",[370,429,391],{"class":390},[370,431,295],{"class":376},[370,433,241],{"class":390},[370,435,436],{"class":380},"'",[370,438,439],{"class":384},"YOUR_LICENSE_HERE",[370,441,436],{"class":380},[370,443,241],{"class":390},[370,445,436],{"class":380},[370,447,448],{"class":384},"123456",[370,450,436],{"class":380},[370,452,241],{"class":390},[370,454,436],{"class":380},[370,456,342],{"class":384},[370,458,436],{"class":380},[370,460,461],{"class":390},");\n",[234,463,464],{},"Open your FiveNet instance in your browser, navigate to the registration page, and use the registration token to create your account.",[234,466,467,468,470,471,474,475,477,478,481],{},"Once registered, log in to FiveNet. If the ",[238,469,303],{}," value is correct, you should see any characters (",[238,472,473],{},"users"," table) associated with the ",[238,476,303],{},"\u002F",[238,479,480],{},"identifier",".",[223,483,485],{"id":484},"_2-install-the-fivenet-plugin-on-your-gameserver","2. Install the FiveNet Plugin on Your Gameserver",[219,487,488],{},"To connect FiveNet to your gameserver:",[490,491,492,501],"ul",{},[234,493,494,495,500],{},"Download the ",[243,496,499],{"href":497,"rel":498},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffivenet-app\u002Fplugins\u002Ftree\u002Fmain\u002Ffivem\u002Ffivenet",[247],"FiveM Plugin code"," from GitHub.",[234,502,503],{},"Install and configure the plugin on your FiveM server.",[505,506,507,512],"callout",{},[219,508,509],{},[350,510,511],{},"Important:",[490,513,514,521],{},[234,515,516,517,520],{},"Read the ",[238,518,519],{},"README.md"," file of the plugin you install and follow the instructions to ensure optimal setup.",[234,522,523],{},"Add event triggers to your ESX plugins as required. Not all events collected by FiveNet are available in the standard ESX plugin code.",[219,525,526,527,481],{},"For additional details and step-by-step setup guidance, refer to the ",[243,528,530],{"href":529},"..\u002Fgameserver\u002Ffivem-plugin\u002Finstallation","plugin installation documentation",[223,532,534],{"id":533},"_3-configure-your-fivenet","3. Configure Your FiveNet",[219,536,537,538,541,542,545,546,549],{},"When logged in with a character selected, you must be able to enable superuser mode (controlled by config option ",[238,539,540],{},"auth.configAdminGroups"," and ",[238,543,544],{},"auth.configAdminUsers","), navigate to your \"FiveNet Settings\" (",[238,547,548],{},"\u002Fsettings\u002Fsettings"," URL path).",[219,551,552],{},"In there go over each tab and configure them to suit your servers' config, jobs and roleplay.",[219,554,555],{},"Some of the most important settings to configure here are:",[231,557,558,566],{},[234,559,560,561],{},"\"Jobs & Tracker\" Tab\n",[490,562,563],{},[234,564,565],{},"Make sure to select the correct enemployed job and grade.",[234,567,568,569],{},"\"Website\" Tab\n",[490,570,571],{},[234,572,573],